.Dd October 28, 2026
.Dt MTKBTFW 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mtkbtfw
.Nd MediaTek MT79xx USB Bluetooth firmware download utility
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl DFIR
.Fl d Ar device_name
.Op Fl f Ar firmware_path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility downloads the patch file to MediaTek MT79xx USB Bluetooth
adapters, which refuse HCI commands until it is loaded.
.Xr ng_ubt 4
attaches to these adapters before the patch is loaded, so
.Nm
detaches it, loads the patch, enables the Bluetooth function and resets
the device so that
.Xr ng_ubt 4
attaches again.
It is normally run by
.Xr devd 8 .
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl D
Enable verbose debugging.
.It Fl d Ar device_name
The ugen device, for example
.Pa ugen1.2 .
.It Fl F
Run even if the same device was handled less than a minute ago.
.It Fl f Ar firmware_path
Directory holding the
.Pa mediatek/
firmware tree, default
.Pa /usr/local/share/mtkbt-firmware .
.It Fl I
Enable informational output.
.It Fl R
Reset the Bluetooth subsystem before loading.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ng_ubt 4 ,
.Xr rtlbtfw 8
.Sh HISTORY
Ported from the MT79xx path of Linux's btmtk driver.
